# Pipeline outputs and staged reference databases: large, reproducible from
# the pipeline + upstream sources, and not meant to live in git history.
# GitHub hard-rejects any file >100MB, and even under that this data (FASTA
# sets, MMseqs2 cluster tables, ANI matrices, staged UniProt dumps) has no
# business being versioned alongside code. Stays on /bigdata; distributed via
# GitHub Releases/Zenodo/etc instead (see README.md).
#
# NOTE (2026-09-07): results/ living here is a holdover from before the
# DeltaGain / DeltaGain_Fungi split (see README.md) — this repo is meant to
# be the pipeline code only, with project-run output belonging in
# DeltaGain_Fungi. Left in place for now because a real run is actively
# writing here; move results/ (and work/) to DeltaGain_Fungi once that run
# completes, rather than mid-run.
results/
lib/uniprot_fungi/
